PRICE_RECOMMENDATION --> DECISION_ENGINE
REPLENISHMENT_AGENT --> DECISION_ENGINE
SUPPLIER_INTEL_AGENT --> DECISION_ENGINE
STORE_TRANSFER_AGENT --> DECISION_ENGINE
PROMOTION_AGENT --> DECISION_ENGINE

DECISION_ENGINE --> RISK_ENGINE
RISK_ENGINE --> POLICY_ENGINE
POLICY_ENGINE --> EXPLAINABILITY_ENGINE
EXPLAINABILITY_ENGINE --> MANAGER_AGENT

MANAGER_AGENT <.[#7C3AED].> HUMAN_IN_LOOP

MANAGER_AGENT --> REPLENISH
MANAGER_AGENT --> PRICE_ACTION
MANAGER_AGENT --> STORE_TRANSFER_ACTION
MANAGER_AGENT --> PROMOTION_ACTION
MANAGER_AGENT --> STORE_TASK

REPLENISH --> ACTUAL_OUTCOME
PRICE_ACTION --> ACTUAL_OUTCOME
STORE_TRANSFER_ACTION --> ACTUAL_OUTCOME
